a_{i}=c_{0}+c_{1}\\frac{f}{1{\\rm kHz}}+c_{2}\\left(\\frac{f}{1{\\rm kHz}}\\right)^ {2}+c_{3}\\left(\\frac{f}{1{\\rm kHz}}\\right)^{3} 

